      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Not a bug. If you feel strongly the safe mode functionality should be changed to not mute voices or apply a different safety shield level, make a new [feature request](https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests).\n\nI'd personally probably keep it as it is right now, and make no changes.\n\nYou do also get a notification when safe mode gets activated in both versions of the UI (VRChat 2026.2.3p3 `Build 1867` and VRChat 2026.3.1p1 `Build 1886`).",
