  "details": "Description\n\nI have to manually unmute people with safe mode, I think it's supposed to be for avatars, but it also turns off voices? can you fix this or make it a setting?\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nY + B + left trigger + right trigger (why don't you add information telling others when clicking on safemode that's a shortcut? Same with pc) then everyone is silent.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Audio\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: Quest (platform: Android - Quest, store: Oculus, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: Android\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.1-1886-a268441585-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report",
